{"type": "doc", "version": 1, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Found while testing "}, {"type": "text", "text": "SV-12435", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/browse/SV-12435"}}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Summary"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "On an imported invoice, the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Quantity", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " of a labor or sublet line is right on screen but wrong in the downloaded PDF. The PDF shows the hours multiplied by 60 (the minutes): 2.5 hours prints as "}, {"type": "text", "text": "150.00", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", 3 hours as "}, {"type": "text", "text": "180.00", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Part quantities are fine. A customer who receives the PDF sees 150.00 \u00d7 $40.00 = $100.00, which does not add up."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Where it happens: ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Reproducible on production, and also on the QA environment it was found on: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "sv12435.qa.shopview.com", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://sv12435.qa.shopview.com"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". It was not caused by the SV-12435 fix (that fix only changed colours on the screen)."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Steps to reproduce (production)"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Log in to "}, {"type": "text", "text": "app.shopview.com", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://app.shopview.com"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Check that the location at the top right says "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Trucks Hill 2", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (change it there if not)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In the top menu click "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Work Orders", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " and stay on the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "All", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " tab."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "On the right of the filter bar, click the list view button (three lines with dots, box 1 in Picture 1)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Click "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Status", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", tick only "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Imported", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", then click anywhere outside the menu. The button now reads "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Status: Imported", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (box 2)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Click the row "}, {"type": "text", "text": "ZZQTYPDF-P", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (customer aqeel transport 56, box 3). The imported invoice opens."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Look at the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Quantity", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " column on screen: Tow in "}, {"type": "text", "text": "3.00", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", Brake inspection "}, {"type": "text", "text": "2.50", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", Brake pad "}, {"type": "text", "text": "4", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". These match the import file."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "At the top right of the invoice click the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Download", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " button (arrow pointing down, box A in Picture 2) and open the PDF."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In the PDF the Quantity column shows Tow in "}, {"type": "text", "text": "180.00", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", Brake inspection "}, {"type": "text", "text": "150.00", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", Brake pad "}, {"type": "text", "text": "4.00", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". The Rate and Amount columns are the same as on screen."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Picture 1 (production): where to click to reach the imported invoice: 1 list view, 2 Status: Imported, 3 the invoice ZZQTYPDF-P.]"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Picture 2 (production): the same invoice on screen (top) and in the downloaded PDF (bottom). Red: labor and sublet quantities, right on screen, multiplied by 60 in the PDF. Green: the part quantity is correct in both.]"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fastest way to see it: ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "open "}, {"type": "text", "text": "this imported invoice on production", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://app.shopview.com/imported-work-orders/006fbf58-fcbe-43f0-992b-e95060fb7318"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", then click the Download button at the top right and compare the Quantity column with the screen."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Expected behaviour"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The PDF shows the same quantity as the screen and the import file (2.50, not 150.00). Source: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "History Import - Overview", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PM/pages/141099010/History+Import+-+Overview"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": \u201cAll values import exactly as they appear in the file.\u201d and "}, {"type": "text", "text": "History Import - Internal Training", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PM/pages/140967940/History+Import+-+Internal+Training"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " \u00a79.1 Labor Rows: \u201cStore Line Title, Line Description, Tech Story, Qty, Rate, Total, Tax.\u201d (\u00a79.5: Sublet \u201cBehaves like Labor rows.\u201d)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "mention", "attrs": {"id": "712020:1f21c3b6-c183-4d46-9561-7b79f0e197ab", "text": "@Milos Vasic"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "mention", "attrs": {"id": "712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20", "text": "@Chris Ward"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " please confirm: should the PDF be fixed to show the hours, or should it stay as it is?"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Current behaviour"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The downloaded PDF prints labor and sublet quantities in minutes (hours \u00d7 60). The screen shows them in hours."}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"isNumberColumnEnabled": false, "layout": "default"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Environment", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Imported invoice", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Line", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qty in file", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "On screen", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "In PDF", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Production"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ZZQTYPDF-P"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Labor (Brake inspection)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.5"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.50"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "150.00"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Production"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ZZQTYPDF-P"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sublet (Tow in)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3.00"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "180.00"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Production"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ZZQTYPDF-P"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Part (Brake pad)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "4"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "4"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "4.00"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Production"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ZZ9818-P"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Labor"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1.00"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "60.00"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "QA sv12435"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ZZQTYPDF-QA"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Labor / Sublet / Part"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.5 / 3 / 4"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.50 / 3.00 / 4"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "150.00 / 180.00 / 4.00"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "QA sv12435"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ZZ12435-INV1"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Labor"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1.00"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "60.00"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Picture 3 (QA environment sv12435): same result on the branch where it was found.]"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Note: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "SV-12501", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/browse/SV-12501"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " plans to build the on-screen imported invoice from the same template as the PDF. If that is done before this is fixed, the screen would show 150.00 too."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Where it is in the code: ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "the import stores the labor/sublet quantity \u00d7 60 ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "ImportCommandHandler.php L253-L264", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://github.com/ShopView/shopview/blob/1c2403e5636cd25f1d43e59860c1fab5c7102ad0/api/src/Administration/Import/Application/WorkOrderHistorical/ImportCommandHandler.php#L253-L264"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). The screen turns it back into hours ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "ImportedInvoice.vue L205", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://github.com/ShopView/shopview/blob/1c2403e5636cd25f1d43e59860c1fab5c7102ad0/app/src/components/ts/work-orders/imported/ImportedInvoice.vue#L205"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), but the PDF template prints the stored number as it is ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "imported-invoice.html.twig L545", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://github.com/ShopView/shopview/blob/1c2403e5636cd25f1d43e59860c1fab5c7102ad0/api/templates/invoices/imported-invoice.html.twig#L545"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Environment: ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "production app.shopview.com build v26.45.3-fc08f23 and QA environment sv12435.qa.shopview.com build v26.45.3-8f11821, checked 10 Nov 2026 around 17:00 UTC, Chrome on desktop 1600 \u00d7 900, admin user."}]}]}
